    {
      "uid": "zhcn:493767123aff313ce3b9216b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "工作告一段落，我觉得肚子饿了，\n于是来到商店街想吃点东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2bd779775d2bd3704e1d87b971aa93148ad0781d126143e7b529ca338c92036",
