    {
      "uid": "zhcn:708ee74a0771825f08e80873",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“这故事设定是怎样啊……”\n我忍住不去询问这个问题，\n继续倾听黄金船的故事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d5f4469a51114a29f2e8602695e21af3590fc17c5ea8699611857154d529de6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
